The legal text in this repository (every file under a law's folder) is the consolidated legislation of Bermuda as
published on Bermuda Laws Online (https://www.bermudalaws.bm) by the Attorney-General's Chambers, Government of
Bermuda: "This website and its contents are Crown Copyright The Government of Bermuda - All Rights Reserved".
Copyright and Designs Act 2004 (Bermuda), s. 199(1): "Her Majesty is entitled to copyright in every Act of the
Legislature." No licence to reuse it has been given. This repository is private and must not be made public
without the Government of Bermuda's permission.

Lexifina's own contributions (the tools, the scripts in tools/build/, the arrangement into files, the commit
messages, README.md, REPRODUCE.md, SOURCES.md and the data/ tables derived from the notes) are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
